-- stella's queries
1. source 01_phoneNum_onAppeal.sql
gets phone number, client title for all clients with a case whose status is "on appeal"

2. source 02_hearing_elpasedTime.sql
gets case title, elapsed time (difference in time between most recent hearing and oldest hearing) for all cases that have at least two hearings

3. source 03_partnerName_numAssignments.sql
gets lawyer name, number of cases assigned to for all partners at the firm in descending order of num assignments
